# A cyclic grammar (b ⇒ a ⇒ b) is rejected. With the conflict it causes
# declared, the generated parser reduced around the cycle forever on "x".
# error: cyclic_grammar.grammar:16:5:
# error: the grammar is cyclic (b ⇒ a ⇒ b)
@lexer
tokens
    x
    eof
    err
'x'   → x
.     → err

@parser
@conflicts
    reduce b → a over c → a  1  # test
b = a → (b 1)
top! = c
c = a → (c 1)
a = b → (a 1)
  | X
